  (text "SCHEMATIC PASS 1 - CONTROL BOARD SAFETY STACK FROM MASTERTEMP 125 REV C FIGURE 24"
    (at 25.4 25.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "ca1c816b-36e3-4d13-8bc7-6905e7939018")
  )
  (text "J3 SAFETY STACK TERMINALS, MANUAL ORDER:\n1 PS - water pressure switch\n2 HLS - high limit switch\n3 ES1 - extra switch / jumper position\n4 AFS - air-flow proving switch, dynamic only\n5 AGS - automatic gas shutoff switch\n6 SFS - stack flue sensor/fault input group\n7 GAS - gas-valve-related monitor only"
    (at 25.4 35.56 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "e8f4641f-7054-4451-8e0e-6864ec08da26")
  )
  (text "STATIC HEAT ENABLE CHAIN:\nFIREMAN_CLOSED -> PS_CLOSED -> HLS_CLOSED -> AGS_CLOSED -> ES1_CLOSED_OR_JUMPERED -> THERMISTOR_RANGE_OK -> SFS_RANGE_OK -> SAFETY_STATIC_OK.\nAFS is intentionally excluded from this pre-fire gate and remains a dynamic airflow-proving input."
    (at 25.4 76.2 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "8423448a-4e0c-4b0a-86a7-214d4b8b34df")
  )
  (text "FIREMAN'S SWITCH:\nManual page 29 specifies the Fireman's Switch/timer completes the heater 24 VAC control-board circuit.\nExternal relay/contact rating target: 24 VAC at 0.5 A. Do not apply line voltage."
    (at 25.4 106.68 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "d0f2888b-b2f0-41c4-aea1-1a2e67290873")
  )
  (text "DRY-CONTACT SENSE CHANNELS:\nUse isolated wetting current and optocoupler inputs for contact diagnostics where practical.\nFirmware may report which safety opened, but firmware must not bypass an open safety."
    (at 142.24 40.64 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "f85ab352-d105-458f-83ff-aa47f2ac949f")
  )
  (text "AFS DYNAMIC POLICY:\nAFS must be monitored for sane idle/open and run/proved behavior after blower/IND activity.\nDo not require AFS closed before the heat request. If AFS opens while firing, drop TH immediately and fault."
    (at 142.24 71.12 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "0ce83133-7125-4bd8-93c3-e062247b437f")
  )
